  </section>

  <section class="row-am white-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
          <h2>Seamless Rails Migrations with Zero Downtime</h2>
          <p class="lead">Transform legacy systems into modern, scalable Ruby on Rails applications. Our migration services help Dallas-Fort Worth businesses modernize their technology infrastructure while preserving data integrity and minimizing business disruption.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row-am gray-bg pt-5 pb-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 text-center mb-4">
          <h2>Migration Services We Provide</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
          <div class="service-card h-100 p-4 white-bg">
            <h3>Legacy System Migration</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>PHP, Java, .NET to Ruby on Rails migration</li>
              <li>Monolith to microservices transformation</li>
              <li>Database migration (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB)</li>
              <li>Data integrity verification and validation</li>
              <li>Incremental migration with parallel systems</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
          <div class="service-card h-100 p-4 white-bg">
            <h3>Rails Version Upgrades</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Rails 4.x to Rails 7+ upgrade paths</li>
              <li>Ruby version upgrades (2.x to 3.x)</li>
              <li>Gem dependency updates and compatibility fixes</li>
              <li>Deprecation warnings resolution</li>
              <li>Test suite updates and comprehensive testing</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
          <div class="service-card h-100 p-4 white-bg">
            <h3>Cloud Migration</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>On-premise to cloud migration (AWS, Azure, GCP)</li>
              <li>Containerization with Docker and Kubernetes</li>
              <li>Infrastructure as Code (Terraform, CloudFormation)</li>
              <li>Auto-scaling and load balancing implementation</li>
              <li>Cost optimization and cloud architecture design</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
          <div class="service-card h-100 p-4 white-bg">
            <h3>Platform Modernization</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>API-first architecture implementation</li>
              <li>Frontend framework integration (React, Vue, Hotwire)</li>
              <li>Mobile backend API development</li>
              <li>Third-party service integration and optimization</li>
              <li>Modern CI/CD pipeline setup</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row-am white-bg pt-5 pb-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
          <h2>Our Migration Methodology</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row mt-4">
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
          <div class="approach-step">
            <div class="step-number">01</div>
            <h4>Assessment & Planning</h4>
            <p><strong>Comprehensive Analysis:</strong> We analyze your existing system architecture, codebase, database schema, and dependencies to create a detailed migration roadmap.</p>
            <p><strong>Risk Assessment:</strong> Identify potential migration risks and develop mitigation strategies.</p>
            <p><strong>Success Metrics:</strong> Define clear KPIs and success criteria for the migration.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
          <div class="approach-step">
            <div class="step-number">02</div>
            <h4>Incremental Migration</h4>
            <p><strong>Phased Approach:</strong> Migrate functionality in manageable phases to minimize risk and enable continuous validation.</p>
            <p><strong>Parallel Systems:</strong> Run old and new systems in parallel to ensure data consistency and enable rollback if needed.</p>
            <p><strong>Continuous Testing:</strong> Comprehensive automated testing at every stage of migration.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
          <div class="approach-step">
            <div class="step-number">03</div>
            <h4>Deployment & Support</h4>
            <p><strong>Zero-Downtime Deployment:</strong> Strategic cutover planning to minimize or eliminate downtime.</p>
            <p><strong>Data Migration Validation:</strong> Rigorous data integrity checks and verification processes.</p>
            <p><strong>Post-Migration Support:</strong> Extended support period to ensure stability and address any issues.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row-am gray-bg pt-5 pb-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
          <h2>Why Migrate to Ruby on Rails?</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row mt-4">
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
          <h4>Development Velocity</h4>
          <p>Rails' convention-over-configuration philosophy and comprehensive ecosystem enable 30-40% faster development cycles compared to many legacy frameworks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
          <h4>Cost Efficiency</h4>
          <p>Reduced development time, lower maintenance costs, and better resource utilization lead to significant long-term savings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
          <h4>Modern Architecture</h4>
          <p>Access to modern architectural patterns, microservices support, and seamless integration with contemporary frontend frameworks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
          <h4>Scalability</h4>
          <p>Rails applications can scale to handle millions of requests with proper architecture, caching strategies, and cloud infrastructure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
          <h4>Security</h4>
          <p>Built-in security features protect against SQL injection, XSS, CSRF, and other common vulnerabilities out of the box.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
          <h4>Talent Pool</h4>
          <p>Access to a vibrant community of skilled Rails developers in Dallas-Fort Worth and across Texas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="row-am white-bg pt-5 pb-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
          <h2>Migration Success Stories</h2>
          <p>We've successfully migrated applications across diverse industries:</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row mt-4">
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
          <div class="success-story p-4 gray-bg">
            <h4>E-Commerce Platform Migration</h4>
            <p>Migrated a legacy PHP e-commerce platform processing $50M+ annually to modern Rails architecture, resulting in:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>85% reduction in page load times</li>
              <li>67% increase in online revenue</li>
              <li>$2.3M annual infrastructure savings</li>
              <li>Zero downtime during cutover</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
          <div class="success-story p-4 gray-bg">
            <h4>Healthcare System Modernization</h4>
            <p>Transformed a 20-year-old patient management system to HIPAA-compliant Rails platform:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Migrated 500K+ patient records with 100% data integrity</li>
              <li>Achieved SOC 2 Type II compliance</li>
              <li>Reduced system maintenance costs by 60%</li>
              <li>Improved provider efficiency by 35%</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%= render(:partial => 'layouts/sec8interestedblock') %>
